 "text": "Hey there, how are you feeling? Not rude, but they might want give it a few minutes just in case your body keeps digesting for hours. Asking right after you finish means you were only eating for the wait. You can do a combined check with the waiter, or each write on your check which way it goes. If you do the combined check, the waiter keeps it. One ten for each of you and one for the waiter, then multiples for each person. It looks nice and is easy to read. You' welcome. Some of these little rules are only habits if someone tells you about them once.",
